- [ ] Verify no deprecation warnings in server startup logs
- [ ] Run backend tests: `pytest tests/` must pass

**Technical Notes**
- Check brother_ql GitHub: https://github.com/pklaus/brother_ql
- Likely need to replace devicedependent imports with new model-specific modules
- May affect printer model detection logic
- If no printer hardware available, use brother_ql test fixtures

