### P2 (MEDIUM) - Optimizations

#### P2-001: Optimize Sentry Bundle Size
**Status**: Not Started
**Effort**: Medium (3-5 hours)
**Dependencies**: None
**Spec Reference**: Bundle optimization goals • **Status Reference**: STATUS-2025-10-15-044325.md §"Bundle Optimization Status"

**Description**
Sentry integrations contribute ~110 KB (35%) of the 368 KB bundle. Many integrations (Replay, Feedback, Canvas) may not be actively used. Removing unused integrations could save 50-80 KB.

**Evidence from STATUS:**
```
Bundle Composition:
- React DOM: 169 KB (53.6%)
- Sentry (all): ~110 KB (35%)
  - Replay: 75 KB
  - Feedback: 19 KB
  - Canvas: 8 KB
  - Core: 8 KB
- App Code: ~37 KB (11.7%)
```

**Acceptance Criteria**
- [ ] Audit Sentry integration usage in src/utils/error-tracking.ts
- [ ] Determine which integrations are actually used (Replay, Feedback, Canvas)
- [ ] Remove unused Sentry integrations from initialization
- [ ] Remove unused Sentry imports from error-tracking.ts
- [ ] Build and measure new bundle size: `npm run build`
- [ ] Target: Reduce bundle to 290-320 KB (50-80 KB savings)
- [ ] Verify error tracking still works in browser
- [ ] Test Sentry error reporting with manual error trigger
- [ ] Update documentation with Sentry integration decisions

**Technical Notes**
- Sentry Replay (75 KB) is largest - determine if session replay is needed
- Sentry Feedback (19 KB) - user feedback widget, may not be used
- Sentry Canvas (8 KB) - canvas recording, likely not needed
- Keep Sentry Core and Browser integration (required for error tracking)
- Check if SENTRY_DSN environment variable is even set in production

